=== HYPOTHESIS ===
# p_4f8a — Razor on the shelf, tight cooking window (fork of p_c007)

Fork of p_c007 with two corrections driven by the claim tallies. First, Yuki's razor is NOT at the bathroom sink at 07:00 on weekdays; six consecutive 07:00 passes found it on the bathroom shelf. The 03:00 sink sightings (x4) reflect the previous evening's use—she shaves in the evening and leaves the razor at the sink, then by 07:00 the next morning it has been put back on the shelf (or she shaves quickly and returns it). The 18:00 sink sighting (x1) is consistent with an evening shave in progress. The razor's resting home is the shelf, not the sink. Second, the cooking window is tightened from 18:00–19:30 to 18:30–19:30: the 18:00 pass shows the cutting board and pan still in their resting spots (cupboard/sink) on some days, and the 19:00 pass is when the counter is reliably loaded. The broader 18:00 start was generating against-tallies from looks at the counter before cooking actually begins.

What changed from the parent: razor_yuki resting target moved from sink_ba_ba1 to bathroom_shelf_ba1; the razor claim now expects the shelf at 07:00; the cooking-implement window narrowed to 18.5–19.5h; the cutting board and pan "almost_always" block now starts at 18.5 instead of 17.5.

